    ;
CI[i] = (j - 1) / 10.0 +
        (i / 10.0 - Cl[j - 1]) / ((Cl[j] - Cl[j - 1]) * 10.0);
```

Same pattern - if j=0, `Cl[-1]` is out of bounds.

